WEBVTT

00:04:00.542 --> 00:04:01.809
Nope.

00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:05.042
(Laughter)

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:09.643
OK, this --

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:11.309
Oh, nice.

00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:13.726
OK, this one's interesting.
There's a couple here.

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.559
I will start with maybe this one.

00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:18.559
This one's interesting,
because the writing undulates.

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:20.476
There's a sort of an up and down thing,

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.684
which normally -- not always --
normally means

00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.893
that the person doesn't know
the answer to the question themselves,

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:28.393
so it's normally a question
about the future, right?

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:30.059
That sort of suggests uncertainty.